 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 515952,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "One of the big draws at this year’s state fair is the pig race. There are 15 entrants, and prizes are given to the top three finishers. How many different combinations of top-three finishes could there be?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"_{15}{P_3} = 2{,}730\">_{15}{P_3} = 2{,}730</span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The permutation of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"{\\rm{nPr}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{(n - r)!}}\"></span>where 1 ≤ <i>r</i> ≤ <i>n</i>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{15P3}} = \\frac{{15!}}{{\\left( {15 - 3} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{15!}}{{12!}} =  \\frac{{15 \\times 14 \\times 13 \\times 12!}}{{12!}} = 2,730\"></span></p>\n<p>There are 2,730 ways to pick the top three finishers.</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
